      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC TOM (2) is a solid beginner and with a good start can clear the draw. Last start finished 4th in a Other on September 10 over 400m at this track behind Major Queen beaten 6 lengths (23.42). Looks hard to beat with even luck. BOMB ROCKY (4) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when third beaten 6 lengths (23.54). Looks suited by the longer journey this time. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Can feature again. MAGIC NANCY (1) recorded a win over 400m at this track in a dynamic 23.06 last start. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. CANYA FEEL IT (8) was strongly fancied on the back of a win two starts ago but finished fourth last time (23.41) at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw.",
